115 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 76 0 R
/E (They have not only run international recruitment but set up and taken over British boarding schools and made them financially successful through the hardest decade the sector has faced: COVID, the cost-of-living crisis and now VAT on fees. They have sat in your chair, carried the cost and the risk, and filled their own boarding houses before being asked to help fill anyone else's.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 76 0 R
/E (That is why the function can work from the first day rather than being built from scratch: established overseas offices, recruitment teams in key markets, a managed network of more than 700 vetted agents, and working relationships across the regions that matter. These are not promises to be funded later. They are a working capability you plug into, run by people who do the work rather than advise on it.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
