<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (Most of the market reaches the world from the outside and in pieces: agents who make introductions and move on, networks you join, and fairs you attend twice a year. BEP is different because it is built around pupil fit and operational delivery. It coordinates every pupil and every agent into one process, asks for no exclusivity, and flexes to be your function where you have none or the scaffold for your team where you do. A full service table at the end of this document shows how the function works across each stage of the journey.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
