233 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (The honest place to begin is not a contract but a question: where is your current international enrolment strong, and where is it thin? BEP starts with a no-cost, no-obligation audit of your coverage and process against the markets, pupil profile and nationality balance you want, under an NDA with a written undertaking not to approach any agent it sees. The audit includes a market and recruitment-strategy review by experienced specialists, so the school can see where the clearest opportunities lie before committing to a route. Where your setup is already strong, we will say so.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (Only where we both see real opportunity does anything follow. From there: agree the route that fits you; a school visit and immersion so BEP understands your proposition and priorities; a market and recruitment strategy; an agreed roadmap of markets, activity and campaigns; then BEP takes up the coordination, running or scaffolding the function as one joined-up process. Founding School Partners move first and enter the next recruitment cycle already coordinated rather than still setting up.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (BEP is forming a small, deliberately curated group of Founding School Partners, not opening membership at volume. The cohort is kept limited and the overlap between schools managed, so that each school receives meaningful attention and a clear place in the market. Selection is on alignment with the model, readiness for international growth, operational fit, pupil-profile clarity and appetite for a long-term working relationship.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (Founding School Partners shape the model as it develops and enter on the clearest commercial terms BEP will offer. Whichever route a school takes, it keeps its existing agents and structures, commits to no exclusivity, and gains a single coordinated function across its whole international intake. The advantage is not simply joining early; it is entering the next recruitment cycle with the function already coordinated rather than still being built.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
